          "settings": {
            "useMarkdownTextFunction": true,
            "markdownTextPattern": "### Markdown/HTML card\n - **Current entity**: ${entityName}.\n - **Current value**: ${Random}.\n - **Element**: ${rule_array}",
            "markdownTextFunction": "const json = JSON.stringify(data[0][\"rule_array\"], null,\n    10);\nvar rules = JSON.parse(json);\n\nconst elements = rules.split(\"{\")\n\nvar parsed_elements = []\n\nfor (let i = 2; i < elements.length; i++) {\n    var fields_string = (elements[i].replace(\"}\", \"\")\n        .replace(\"]\", \"\").slice(0, -1).trim()).split(\n        \",\");\n    let dictionary_rule = {}\n    for (let x of fields_string) {\n        var sides = x.replaceAll(\"\\\"\", \"\").split(\":\")\n        dictionary_rule[sides[0]] = sides[1]\n    }\n    parsed_elements.push(dictionary_rule)\n}\n\nvar headers = Object.keys(parsed_elements[0]);\n\nvar table_headers = \"<tr>\";\n\nfor (let header of headers) {\n    table_headers = table_headers + \"<th>\" + header +\n        \"</th>\"\n}\n\ntable_headers = table_headers + \"</tr>\";\n\nvar table_content = \"\"\n\nfor (let element of parsed_elements) {\n    table_content = table_content + \"<tr><td>\" + element[\n            \"src_ip\"] + \"</td>\" + \"<td>\" + element[\n        \"dst_ip\"] + \"</td>\" + \"<td>\" + element[\"proto\"] +\n        \"</td>\" + \"<td>\" + element[\"src_port\"] + \"</td>\" +\n        \"<td>\" + element[\"dst_port\"] + \"</td>\" + \"<td>\" +\n        element[\"action\"] + \"</td></tr>\";\n}\n\nvar table = \"<table>\" + table_headers + table_content +\n    \"</table>\";\n\nreturn table;",
            "applyDefaultMarkdownStyle": true,
            "markdownCss": ""
          },
